OL,3,GNEWSAMan takes on 100-mile stadium
OL,4,Achallenge for friend
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man is preparing to run more than 100
OL,7,Fmiles (161km) between two football
OL,8,Fstadiums in memory of an 18-year-old
OL,9,Fstudent who died earlier this year from
OL,10,Fmeningitis B (MenB).
OL,12,FAaron Mills died in January while
OL,13,Fvisiting his family in Kidderminster
OL,14,Fduring the Christmas break from his
OL,15,Fstudies at Liverpool John Moores
OL,16,FUniversity.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
