OL,3,GNEWSAMan takes on 100-mile stadium
OL,4,Achallenge for friend
OL,5,
OL,6,FNext month, family friend Shaun McEntee
OL,7,Fwill set off from Aggborough - the home
OL,8,Fof Kidderminster Harriers FC - arriving
OL,9,Ffive days later at Liverpool FC's
OL,10,FAnfield, reflecting Aaron's love of
OL,11,Ffootball.
OL,13,F"He was the biggest Liverpool fan, and
OL,14,Fhe had a season ticket at Harriers,"
OL,15,Fsaid McEntee. " So it seems really
OL,16,Fpoignant."
